        "original_id": "37a34899-31b7-5c76-89bb-16edd2132a4e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Lyon\n- Organizations: United States Air Force, United States Air Force Reserve Command, Headquarters Air Force Reserve\n- Places: Washington, D.C., Robins Air Force Base, Houston County, Georgia\n\nFacts:\n- William Lyon was born on March 9, 1923.\n- William Lyon is a retired major general of the United States Air Force.\n- William Lyon served as Commander of the United States Air Force Reserve Command at Headquarters U.S. Air Force in Washington, D.C.\n- William Lyon also served as commander of Headquarters Air Force Reserve, a separate operating agency located at Robins Air Force Base in Georgia.\n- Robins Air Force Base is a major United States Air Force installation in Houston County, Georgia, United States.\n- Robins Air Force Base has the IATA code WRB and the ICAO code KWRB.",
